Good to hear from you, too! Thanks for your quick reply.  If it is adding the bounds, could you give me an example of how to do so and what values I should use?  Yea, I thought it was weird, too, since it is a very basic VAR model. And I thought dynr runs the model in C, shouldn’t it be even faster than some of the other packages in R for some of the very complex time series models?

